<title>BELGIUM: EU to clear 2.9 bln francs for GAN.</title>
<headline>EU to clear 2.9 bln francs for GAN.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is to approve a French capital injection of 2.86 billion francs into state-controlled insurer GAN at its weekly meeting on Wednesday, a European Commission official said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The proposal to approve the cash injection, which is part of a French plan to restructure the company, comes a bit as a surprise since the Commission had not started a formal investigation into the case. It usually does it for all important rescue plans to allow for rival companies to give their views. -- Brussels newsroom 322 2876841</p>
</text>
